WEBVTT

00:05:58.579 --> 00:06:01.746
you gave us a space to amplify our dreams.

00:06:02.329 --> 00:06:05.621
This is our turn to give you a gift,

00:06:05.663 --> 00:06:07.996
and this drawing is for you.”

00:06:08.704 --> 00:06:10.579
The “Pele de Vidro,”

00:06:10.621 --> 00:06:13.079
even in its absence --

00:06:13.121 --> 00:06:14.413
the idea of it,

00:06:14.454 --> 00:06:16.538
the memory of it --

00:06:16.579 --> 00:06:19.746
continues to be a reflection of Brazil,

00:06:19.788 --> 00:06:21.579
past and present.

00:06:23.329 --> 00:06:26.954
Which I love because even though
it’s an empty lot of rubble,

00:06:26.996 --> 00:06:29.163
it’s still filled with dreams.

00:06:29.496 --> 00:06:30.871
(Portuguese) Muita obrigada.